== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @chickpeas{2/5%can} (can size 15 oz ea; drained), @large gluten-free tortilla wraps{1}, @feta{3/20%cup} (crumbled), @cucumber{1/5} (diced), @cherry tomatoes{3/10%cup} (halved), @red onion{1/10} (thinly sliced), @olive oil{2/5%tbsp}, @smoked paprika{1/5%tsp}, @cumin{1/5%tsp}, @oregano{1/10%tsp}, @plain Greek yogurt{3/20%cup}, @garlic cloves{2/5} (minced), @lemon juice{2/5%tbsp}, @dill or parsley{2/5%tbsp}, @water{2/5%tbsp} (to thin), @Salt + pepper{} (to taste).

== Preparation ==

Roast chickpeas with olive oil and spices. Mix yogurt, garlic, lemon and herbs into a sauce, thinning with water as needed. Warm the gluten-free wrap and fill with chickpeas, vegetables, feta and sauce.
